     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "んです gives an explanation or context; in questions it can ask the reason for a situation.",
     "texto": [
      "Short form + んです. With nouns and -na adjectives, use なんです. It doesn't necessarily add an explicit cause: it arranges the information for the listener.",
      "どうして おくれた ん です か。 (Why were you late? (asking for an explanation))",
      "でんしゃ が おくれた ん です。 (It's that the train was delayed.)"
     ],
